{"id":778340,"title":"01｜来龙去脉：AIGC发展历程及国内外发展现状","content":"AIGC作为人工智能的高级阶段，与传统AI在设计理念上存在本质差异。AI主要处理判别式任务，如内容识别和判断；而AIGC则专注于生成式任务，如根据关键词生成文章、图像或视频。AI的核心目标是模仿和扩展人类智能，处理的数据范围包括文本、语音、图像等。AI技术流派分为行为主义、符号主义和联结主义，其中联结主义是大模型的基础。算法是计算机解决问题的具体步骤，AIGC通过复杂的神经网络实现生成任务。大模型的特点在于其庞大的参数量、复杂的网络结构及生成能力，广泛应用于信息过滤、情感分析、翻译、文本摘要等领域。国内外大语言模型如ChatGPT、Llama架构、文心语言、通义千问等，在多个行业展现出广泛应用前景。大模型的发展历程从Word2Vec到Transformer，再到GPT系列，逐步推动了跨模态和AGI的发展。未来，随着数据和技术的进步，AGI有望成为现实。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":395953,"user_name":"宫小博先生","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2866582,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"CF5A8A2611D75A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/2b/bd/96/3759d4a6.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1732518881,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":143765,"content":"课程资料: https:&#47;&#47;pan.baidu.com&#47;s&#47;182vqOy-vYasJkcm76AWq5Q?pwd=facy","user_name":"编辑回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":2843479,"ctime":1732602340,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":395953,"utype":2}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100768401,"comment_content":"请问有课件么？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":2843479,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/2b/63/57/b8eef585.jpg","nickname":"小虎子11🐯","note":"","ucode":"4C9530B3FB407B","race_medal":0,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":654389,"discussion_content":"课程资料: https://pan.baidu.com/s/182vqOy-vYasJkcm76AWq5Q?pwd=facy","content_length":62,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1732602340,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":8,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}